ishtaria-client (0.5.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The packages and standalone builds connect to the Ishtaria world
    server out of the box: a fresh install can be played at once (saved
    address, ISHTARIA_SERVER_URL and --server still win).

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <cybervitexus@gmail.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 14:04:40 +0100

ishtaria-client (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Loading progress bar with the datadisk's marker, shown as soon as
    the planet is drawn.
  * The detail terrain is baked in parallel; the world no longer stalls
    after the first choice.
  * City map on the minimap (walls, streets, houses, canals); characters
    can follow the player; the camera looks up in dialogues with sky
    ships.
  * Fixed a crash when refreshing sky ships; sheep and pigs face the way
    they walk.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <cybervitexus@gmail.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 05:44:40 +0100

ishtaria-client (0.4.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Natural walk for every Kenney character (retargeted Quaternius walk
    clip).
  * Terrain under the player stays until its rebuilt replacement is
    ready: shadows no longer fall far below the ground and grass no
    longer vanishes while walking.
  * Quest compass labels no longer overlap; the place nearest the
    walking direction keeps its label.
  * 0 A.D. animals no longer walk backwards; the Quaternius fox is fox-
    sized.
  * NPCs that share the player's pack look are no longer drawn as the
    datadisk's hero.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <cybervitexus@gmail.com>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:23:36 +0100

