ishtaria-client (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Load the 16-bit height strip from /world/heightmap with a progress
    bar on the datadisk cover; no run-time relief (ADR 0020).
  * Real walking clips: Quaternius characters use their Walk clip;
    Kenney characters use a walk retargeted from the Quaternius
    Universal Animation Library (CC0).
  * Ignore the clay tablet's Blender source when importing assets.

